; Cloned once per crown, so all five keep the sizing authored here rather than
; having it rebuilt in code. The page tints each copy -- see levels_page.gd.
; A button rather than a picture: every crown can be tapped to ask what it is,
; the ones still to be won as much as the ones already on the shelf. Flat and
; with no face of its own, so what is on screen is the badge and nothing else.
