; Just the number and the name. The best time and the lock reason that used to
; ride along under them made the grid into a wall of small print.
; --- What a crown is, and what it takes ---
; Opened by tapping any crown, won or not. Anywhere else on the screen puts it
; away again: the whole page behind it is one button for that and nothing more.
